Third-party OS icons in this directory
=====================================

The following icons are from Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org),
released under CC0 1.0 Universal:
  apple.svg, debian.svg, fedora.svg, linux.svg, redhat.svg, ubuntu.svg

windows.svg is an original work created for this project.

All trademarks and brand names are the property of their respective owners
and are used here only to identify the supported operating systems.
